      "description": "<p>PM says he asked question upon entering No 10 but does not reveal who gave him ‘clear answer’ that Russia meddled</p><p>Andy Burnham has said it is clear Russia interfered in the Brexit referendum, after seeking answers on the Kremlin’s involvement in the 2016 vote when he entered Downing Street.</p><p>Burnham said he had asked whether Moscow had attempted to influence the referendum and received a confirmation that it had.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/oct/11/andy-burnham-russia-interfered-brexit-vote\">Continue reading...</a>",
